{"id":"n79139-1-8","stage":5,"title":"체벌 · 体罚","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n79139-1-8-1","ko":"떠드는 학생을 때리셨다고요?","zh":"您说您打了那个吵闹的学生？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"떠드는","meaning":"飞，掉；表示积极想做如前所述的行为。","explanation":"뜨다：飞，掉；들다：表示积极想做如前所述的行为。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"뜨다","audio":"/audio/83c29e672f4ac6fe6fc4.mp3"},{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66028","senseId":"4","lemma":"뜨다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"49855","senseId":"1","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떠드는","audio":"/audio/88d05ec9d14bdfd7aee8.mp3"}},{"text":"학생을","meaning":"学生","explanation":"학생：学生；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"학생","audio":"/audio/f24650b42089c29f9027.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31670","senseId":"1","lemma":"학생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학생을","audio":"/audio/6d681e2ba504318ac3db.mp3"}},{"text":"때리셨다고요?","meaning":"打，揍，抽","explanation":"때리다：打，揍，抽；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다고요：重复、强调或确认所说的内容；带 요 时为礼貌表达。","readings":[{"term":"때리다","audio":"/audio/97474f90b9c0f4d70878.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14433","senseId":"1","lemma":"때리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때리셨다고요","audio":"/audio/43dfdd31f8a8856bd37d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"83c29e672f4ac6fe","term":"뜨다","zh":"飞，掉","audio":"/audio/83c29e672f4ac6fe6fc4.mp3","entryId":"66028","definition":"借出的东西收不回来。","pronunciation":["뜨다"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"表示积极想做如前所述的行为。","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"49855","definition":"表示积极想做如前所述的行为。","pronunciation":["들다"]},{"id":"f24650b42089c29f","term":"학생","zh":"学生","audio":"/audio/f24650b42089c29f9027.mp3","entryId":"31670","definition":"在学校学习的人。","pronunciation":["학쌩"]},{"id":"97474f90b9c0f4d7","term":"때리다","zh":"打，揍，抽","audio":"/audio/97474f90b9c0f4d7